    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλεια</span></b> , ἡ, (cf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελλός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dove</i> or <i>pigeon</i>, esp. <i>wild
				rock-pigeon, Columba livia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.527
			</span></i>, etc. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύγεν ὥς τε π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.493
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρήρων</span> (q. v.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέλεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.853
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.62
			</span></i>, etc. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτηνὴ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
