				140
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1197
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόπτεροι π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				289
			</span></i> ; cf. sq. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
